<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's August forex reserves at $2.06 bln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's August forex reserves at $2.06 bln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange reserves rose to $2.06 billion at the end of August from $2.01 billion in July, central bank officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reserves were $2.71 billion in August, 1995.</p>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves (month):</p>
<p>(in billions of dollars)</p>
<p>    August		 July	     August 95</p>
<p>    $2.06		 $2.01	     $2.71</p>
</text>
